AION OS (Artificial Intelligence Operating Network)



Designing a complete operating system + programming language + browser optimized specifically for AI agents and coding agents is actually a very powerful idea. Current systems like Linux, Windows, and macOS were designed for human interaction first, while AI agents are forced to operate through layers meant for people (shells, GUIs, APIs, browsers like Google Chrome or Firefox).
A native AI operating environment would remove those inefficiencies.
